<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8' standalone='yes' ?><hierarchy rotation="0"><node text="Concert stage: Haru Urara (pink) and white-haired Uma dancing in foreground on green checkered floor. Other Umas in background. Tiered seating with lights. LED screens. Lyrics: 'The two of us will soon see / A future full of shining stars'. Photo and menu buttons. Post-race 'Make Debut!' concert." /></hierarchy>